messages.content:
Review this proposed change (review round 1).

Repository: billing-service at ref d58d0178339f27b049a9062a2a609425dafde9f1 (use these as the repo and ref arguments of read_repo_file).

Hypothesis about the failure: The package-lock.json file is out of sync with package.json. The package.json declares a dependency on both "express" (^4.19.2) and "dayjs" (^1.11.10), but package-lock.json only includes "express". This causes `npm ci` to fail with an out-of-sync error.

Proposed unified diff:
```diff
--- a/package-lock.json
+++ b/package-lock.json
@@ -1,17 +1,48 @@
 {
   "name": "billing-service",
   "version": "1.0.0",
   "lockfileVersion": 3,
   "requires": true,
   "packages": {
     "": {
       "name": "billing-service",
       "version": "1.0.0",
       "dependencies": {
-        "express": "^4.19.2"
+        "express": "^4.19.2",
+        "dayjs": "^1.11.10"
       }
     },
     "node_modules/express": {
       "version": "4.19.2",
       "resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/express/-/express-4.19.2.tgz"
+    },
+    "node_modules/dayjs": {
+      "version": "1.11.10",
+      "resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/dayjs/-/dayjs-1.11.10.tgz"
     }
   }
 }
```

Current contents of package-lock.json:
```
{
  "name": "billing-service",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "lockfileVersion": 3,
  "requires": true,
  "packages": {
    "": {
      "name": "billing-service",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "dependencies": {
        "express": "^4.19.2"
      }
    },
    "node_modules/express": {
      "version": "4.19.2",
      "resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/express/-/express-4.19.2.tgz"
    }
  }
}

```
